OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of South West students
OL,4,Aget free MenB jab
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreshers across the South West are
OL,7,Fbeing urged to get two doses of the
OL,8,Fmeningitis B vaccine before term
OL,9,Fstarts.
OL,11,FFirst-year university students are
OL,12,Fabout seven times more at risk of
OL,13,Fmeningococcal disease than other young
OL,14,Fpeople of the same age, according to UK
OL,15,FHealth Security Agency (UKHSA).
OL,17,FSo far, nearly 6,500 doses of the MenB
OL,18,Fvaccine have been administered to young
OL,19,Fpeople across Somerset, Wiltshire,
OL,20,FGloucestershire and Bristol as part of
OL,21,Fa "one-off" NHS vaccination programme
OL,22,Flaunched this summer.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
